{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Structured Network AI Return Format.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Structured Network AI Return Format.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"structured network ai return format structured network ai return format","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Structured Network AI Return Format.md","fileName":"Structured Network AI Return Format.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Structured Network AI Return Format","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network AI Model and Prompt Engineering]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Structured Network AI Return Format.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Structured Network AI Return Format.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"structured network ai return format structured network ai return format","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Structured Network AI Return Format.md","fileName":"Structured Network AI Return Format.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Structured Network AI Return Format","heading":"Structured Network AI Return Format","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A structured return format tells a model how its answer must be organized. JSON supports API integration, YAML offers a readable data representation, and CLI or Ansible-style output can fit an operational workflow. The prompt should name required fields, nesting, and allowable values rather than merely asking for “structured output.”\n\nStructure makes an answer testable, but a parser-ready object can still contain an invalid address or dangerous command. The caller should validate syntax and domain rules after parsing. A stable format also makes [[Iterative Network Prompt Feedback]] precise because corrections can identify a field instead of an ambiguous paragraph.","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Structured Network AI Return Format.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Structured Network AI Return Format.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"structured network ai return format structured network ai return format","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Structured Network AI Return Format.md","fileName":"Structured Network AI Return Format.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Structured Network AI Return Format","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}